\par\par \b \uc2  Canadian Afternoon: Cdn Dlr Ends Weaker, But Off Lows \b0\par\par\uc2 307 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Dezember 1996\par 22:13\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TORONTO (AP-Dow Jones)--The Canadian dollar was weaker against the U.S. dollar late Friday. But it recovered somewhat from the worst levels of the day, aided by still more supportive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2  and a show of stability in the bond market. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar was trading at C$1.3593 at 2102 GMT, down from C$1.3630 at 1300 GMT but up from C$1.3568 late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  A number of traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was selling U.S. dollars around the U.S. dollar highs just above C$1.3635, the third time it's been in the market this week. The bank also sold U.S. dollars at C$1.3530 on Tuesday and at C$1.3590 on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  In the bond market, prices look set to end the session in positive territory Friday, after suffering the worst two-day loss in over a decade on Wednesday and Thursday. At the worst point Thursday, the 30-year bond was down C$4.50 and the yield climbed to 7.13%, from 6.76% two days earlier. \par \par \uc2  The 30-year bond is currently up 0.23 point at 122.78 to yield 7.12%. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said the bond-market rout was sparked as international investors took profits on the strong bull run of recent months, and as the capital flowed out of the country it exacerbated the Canadian dollar's losses. \par \par \uc2  Nonetheless, traders expressed continued nervousness over the Canadian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's medium-term prospects given huge losses over the past couple weeks. The U.S. dollar has climbed well over 2% against the Canadian dollar since hitting a 1996 low at C$1.3280 in early November. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 06-12-96 \par \par \uc2  2113GMT \par \par \uc2  1158 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011014dsc601l30\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
