\par\par \b \uc2  Canada/Jobs -2: Canadian Dlr Decline May Forestall Easing \b0\par\par\uc2 301 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Juli 1996\par 16:48\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    "This strong U.S. report has killed the possibility of\par a rate cut here," said Ted Carmichael, senior economist at\par J.P. Morgan Securities Canada.\par    With the U.S. economy strong and at or through the\par peak of the cycle, demand out of the U.S. for Canadian\par goods will help drag down Canada's unemployment rate from\par the current 10% level, he said.\par    "We think that we'll see a quick and decisive\par reversal," he said, adding he wouldn't be surprised to see\par Canada's unemployment rate down to 9% in the next three or\par four months.\par    Carmichael pointed to a similar occurence in April of\par 1994, when the country's unemployment rate shot up to 11%\par from 10.6%. And as in this month's report, most of the\par job losses were concentrated in Quebec. Four months later,\par the unemployment rate was down to 10%.\par    Meanwhile, the sharp drop in the Canadian dollar\par Friday, which prompted the Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Canada\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and\par sell U.S.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  dollars to help brake the decline, may have\par given the bank the desired easing in overall monetary\par conditions, said Carmichael.\par    The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  measures the relative stimulus in the\par economy through its Monetary Conditions Index, a measure\par of the combined effects of interest rates and the Canadian\par dollar on overall demand.\par    The Canadian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  was down almost 1% at its lowest\par point this morning over levels Thursday, as the U.S.\par dollar climbed from C$1.3589 late Thursday to a peak of\par 1.3700 after the two jobs reports Friday.\par    In addition, other economists noted that the Bank of\par Canada may hesitate to ease rates if the weakness in the\par Canadian dollar persists.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (MORE) DOW JONES NEWS 07-05-96\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1048EDT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  4020 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020011013ds7501kwa\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
