\par\par \b \uc2  Cdn Afternoon -2: Mkt Wary Of Central Bk Action \b0\par\par\uc2 338 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 April 1996\par 23:52\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar has been finding solid support around C$1.3540. But the 'market is still long (in Canadian dollars),' said a dealer with a Canadian investment house who thinks the Canadian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is going to get stronger still. \par \par \uc2  As the Canadian dollar gains, however, market players will become increasingly concerned that the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2  will either \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to slow its rise or cut short-term interest rates once again, leaving it less attractive. \par \par \uc2  A stronger Canadian dollar tightens monetary conditions in the economy. Although it has shown signs of improving health of late, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be wary of allowing the rising \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to erase the stimulatory effects of recent cuts in short-term interest rates, said observers. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Canada last cut it key administered rate by 1/4 point on March 21. It is now allowed to trade in a band between 4.75% and 5.00%. \par \par \uc2  It 'will worry them,' said Davenport of the Canadian dollar strength. 'The overall (economic) recovery is so significantly dependent upon the competitive valuation of Canada's exports' that a move toward a stronger Canadian dollar is a concern for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Looking ahead, meanwhile, traders will focus intently on Friday's U.S. jobs report. News early last month of 705,000 new non-farm jobs in February sent the North American bond markets tumbling, and players are wary of another sharp increase. \par \par \uc2  Salomon Brothers is prediciting a revised February number down at 665,000 and a 100,000 increase in March. \par \par \uc2  Although the markets are officially closed Friday for Good Friday, many Canadian desks will be partly staffed for the jobs figures. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par These are the exchange rates at 2120 GMT Monday, at 1300 GMT and late\par Friday.\par U.S./CDN         1.3544   1.3540     1.3592\par CDN/MARK         1.0948   1.0939     1.0863\par CDN/YEN          79.38    79.38      78.92\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 01-04-96\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 2152GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1158 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds4102txn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
