e postponed until the next century because of the sharp economic slowdown in Germany and the social unrest that planned spending cuts are provoking in France. German officials refuted the report. \par \par \uc2  'There are a lot of little stories coming out indicating that the governments in Europe are coming to the conclusion that EMU's not workable,' said Kemp. 'The knee-jerk reaction is to buy marks.' \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 26-01-96 \par \par \uc2  2207GMT \par \par \uc2  1033 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds1q00sg8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
