\par\par \b \uc2  Canadian Midday:  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Buys Cdn Dlr As Pressure Mounts \b0\par\par\uc2 346 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Oktober 1995\par 18:50\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TORONTO (AP-DJ)--The Canadian dollar was sharply lower in volatile dealings around midday Friday amid worries about \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2 's political future and despite \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar was trading at C$1.3502 at 1628 GMT, up from C$1.3439 at 1200 GMT and C$1.3420 late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was buying Canadian dollars around the C$1.3490-C$1.3495 level, if only to slow the decline started late Thursday after news of a poll from Angus Reid Group. \par \par \uc2  The poll suggested that sovereignty had support of 45.4% of decided voters, while 43.6% were opposed, with 11% still undecided with just over a week to go before the actual vote on Oct. 30. By dividing the decided voters proportionately, the poll gave the 'yes' side 51% and the 'no' side 49%. \par \par \uc2  There was some resistance around C$1.3500. \par \par \uc2  'It could be just a resting stop before we take a stab at a new level,' said a trader at a foreign bank. He also said that 'this thing should pop - if it doesn't pop today, it will by next week.' \par \par \uc2  Three previous polls done by other firms reported similar findings, but they had little market impact. However, many traders thought it unrealistic that the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  could continue to hold at stronger levels with so much risk inherent in the Quebec referendum. A correction was only a matter of time, they said. \par \par \uc2  Barry Davenport, senior vice president of the treasury group at the Bank of Montreal, said that the market was technically overbought in recent weeks and was left in a fragile state, and vulnerable to correction. \par \par \uc2  These were the exchange rates at 1628 GMT Friday, 1200 GMT and late Thursday. U.S./CDN         1.3502    1.3439    1.3420 CDN/Mark         1.0347    1.0490    1.0488 CDN/Yen          74.19     74.82     74.81 \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 20-10-95 \par \par \uc2  1650GMT \par \par \uc2  1158 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025drak088ma\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
