\par\par \b \uc2  Bank Of  \highlight22\uc2 Canada Intervened \highlight\uc2  Continuously As Cdn Dlr Weakened \b0\par\par\uc2 234 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Oktober 1995\par 19:28\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TORONTO (AP-DJ)--The Bank of Canada was buying Canadian dollars continuously through midday, said \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers, hoping to slow the fall of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the wake of weakness sparked by political uncertainty. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  began to buy Canadian dollars when the U.S. dollar was trading at C$1.3375 and continued to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  as the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  steadily lost ground to trade at C$1.3510. A number of traders reported the bank \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  earlier in the C$1.3390-C$1.3395 area. "They are following their usual \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern," said a dealer with one of the large Canadian banks, of the continuous \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Other traders said the bank was seeking to control the rate of decline of the Canadian dollar. It began falling late Thursday on news of a poll from Angus Reid suggesting that support for sovereignty in the Province of Quebec stood at 45.4% and opposition at just 43.6% among decided voters. \par \par \uc2   11% of respondents were still undecided with just over a week to go before the actual vote on Oct. 30. By dividing the decided voters proportionately, the poll gave the "yes" side 51% and the "no" side 49%. The U.S. dollar was getting about C$1.3380 Wednesday, before the market began falling. \par \par \uc2  (END) DOW JONES NEWS 10-20-95 \par \par \uc2  1328EDT \par \par \uc2  4020 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020011024drak02dg6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
