\par\par \b \uc2  Bank of  \highlight22\uc2 Canada \highlight\uc2 / \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  -2: Frequent Moves Less Effective \b0\par\par\uc2 262 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 April 1995\par 20:01\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  'Overall, we expect that this change in \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  tactics will result in less frequent incidents of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but when \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  does take place, it is likely to be carried out in a more visible manner by \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in larger amounts and using \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  brokers more often,' the letter said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said the point of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is to act as a 'signaling tool' to the market in a way that suggests broader changes to policy could be on the way. \par \par \uc2  'Our analysis of the current \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  techniques we use is that they are not as effective as they could be in this regard,' the bank said. \par \par \uc2  Previously, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would frequently enter the market to smooth out sharp movements in the Canadian dollar. \par \par \uc2  Traders said it remains to be seen how effective this shift in tactics will be. \par \par \uc2  'Sending a strong signal is certainly preferable to a weak one,' said Mario Agnastiniotis, senior economist with MMS International. \par \par \uc2  Agnastiniotis said that stronger \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets will enable the Bank to decrease its reliance on interest rates to support the Canadian dollar. \par \par \uc2  But John Johnston, deputy chief economist with the Royal Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2 , said less frequent \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  may also increase the volatility between the Canadian dollar and the U.S. dollar. \par \par \uc2  He added, however, that both \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  continue to be two of the most stable in the world, and that limited exchange rate volatility should not hamper the economy. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 17-04-95 \par \par \uc2  1801GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr4h02ohk\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
