\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Canada \highlight\uc2 's  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  to  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  less in the market. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Paul Casciato \par \uc2 495 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 April 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TORONTO (Reuter) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Thursday it will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  less often in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to influence the rate of its dollar because frequent actions have become less effective. \par \par \uc2  In an April 5 letter to major dealers obtained by Reuters, the Bank of Canada said Canadian Finance Minister Paul Martin approved the change in policy. \par \par \uc2  "We expect this change in \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  tactics will result in less frequent incidents of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but when \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  does take place, it is likely to be carried out in a more visible manner by \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in larger amounts and using \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  brokers more often," the letter said. \par \par \uc2  The Canadian dollar has suffered under frequent bouts of volatility since the Mexican financial crisis rocked North American \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  late last year. In January the Canadian dollar hit a nine-year low of 70.07 cents, but rallied back in recent weeks to its current 72.87 cents level. \par \par \uc2  Bank of Canada officials confirmed the contents of the letter but cautioned the tactics will not change the Bank's basic stance toward the Canadian dollar. \par \par \uc2  "We're just changing the technicalities of carrying out \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said an official at the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2 . "We're not really changing our policy toward the Canadian dollar." \par \par \uc2  In the letter the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  after a certain amount of exchange rate movement in any given trading day, but will not necessarily continue at that same level the following day. \par \par \uc2  "An assessment of underlying pressures on the exchange rate will be factored into the determination of the point at which \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue," the letter said. \par \par \uc2  It said the new strategy will mean the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  less frequently, but will not change the bank's policy of maintaining orderly Canadian markets and smoothing out any large moves in the Canadian dollar. \par \par \uc2  The Bank said it will also use larger amounts in each \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  trade. \par \par \uc2  The changes come as the result of a recently completed review of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the first since the 1980s, the letter said. \par \par \uc2  "Such a review has recently been undertaken and the conclusions of this work support the idea that \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is most useful when used as a signalling tool," the letter said. \par \par \uc2  The Bank said it realised that its previous strategy had become less useful because of the growth of the market. \par \par \uc2  "The current system (of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), which could be described as one of maintaining orderly markets by leaning against the wind during periods of large or rapid exchange movements was last reviewed in the 1980s," the Bank said. \par \par \uc2  It said the frequency of its current \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategy reduces the newsworthiness of the move. \par \par \uc2  "Our analysis of the current \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  techniques we use is that they are not as effective as they could be in this regard," the Bank said. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011103dr4d08qhp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
