\par\par \b \uc2  Canadian Dollar/Moody's -2: Bank Of Canada Hikes Rates \b0\par\par\uc2 230 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Februar 1995\par 19:25\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar forged as high as C$1.4130, before falling back amid rumors of Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and news that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  raised interest rates another half point through a round of sale and repurchase agreements. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Canada's action was seen setting anew target range for overnight interest rates between 7.75%-8.25%, a hike of 0.50 percentage point from the old range of 7.25%-7.75%. \par \par \uc2  'I think it has stopped the slide,' said David Ricketts, vice president in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  for Canadian Imperial Bank of Commerce in New York. He said expected the Canadian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to trade at its current levels for the rest of the day. \par \par \uc2  Ricketts said that the Moody's announcement came as a surprise to the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, since most has assumed Moody's would want to see Canada's next budeget before passing judgements on the country's debt rating. \par \par \uc2  'Usually a rating service waits until post budget to see how the situation looks - everyone is confused about this,' he said. \par \par \uc2  In its announcement Thursday, Moody's said that Canada's dollar-denominated government debt and the debt of several of its Canadian Crown corporations has also been put on review. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 16-02-95 \par \par \uc2  1825GMT \par \par \uc2  1158 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr2g012aq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal