\par\par \b \uc2  Canadian Dollar Suffers Some Spillover From Mexico Crisis \b0\par\par\uc2  By ANDREW WILLIS \par \uc2 258 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Januar 1995\par 00:16\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TORONTO (AP-DJ)--Shock waves from the economic crisis in Mexico have helped send the Canadian dollar to almost nine-year lows against the U.S. dollar in recent trading sessions, some analysts say. \par \par \uc2  The Canadian dollar, already weakened by perceptions that Canadian interest rates are too low and by worries ahead of the federal budget statement in February, is also seeing some selling as a result of the recent sharp fall in Mexico's new peso, the analysts say. \par \par \uc2  They say there's a trend towards judging the Canadian dollar with the same criteria used on Mexican holdings - and at the moment, the market's verdict is a move to the safe haven of the U.S. dollar. \par \par \uc2  'We've seen a pattern where the Canadian dollar weakens with the Mexican peso. It's a sympathetic reaction; although fundamentals are different, these are two North American \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  with enormous current account deficits and political instability,' says Mark Schwartz, a \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader at Lehman Brothers in New York. \par \par \uc2  On Tuesday, as the Mexican new peso plunged again, the U.S. dollar strengthened sharply against the Canadian dollar, despite reported \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  in defense of the Canadian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Late in New York, the U.S. dollar was at 1.4060 CDN dlrs late Tuesday, up from 1.4018 CDN dlrs late Friday and well above intraday lows Tuesday around 1.3957 CDN dlrs. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 03-01-95 \par \par \uc2  2316GMT \par \par \uc2  1140 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr130012l\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (canada near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw)and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority) \cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjust